# PA-097/PA-098 EOL 根治：统一换行策略，防止跨平台 CRLF 污染。
# 策略：文本默认 LF 入库且 LF 检出（eol 属性优先于 core.autocrlf，
# Windows 下次全量检出 213 w/crlf 会翻转为 LF，为一次性预期 churn）。
# 入库一律归一化为 LF。审查时禁止越权改写他人文件行尾（PA-098 事故教训）。
# 本次只定策略，不做全库 renormalize（步骤见文件尾注释，可选、需单独评审）。

* text=auto eol=lf

.gitattributes text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
.githooks/** text eol=lf

# Windows 批处理保留 CRLF（cmd.exe 对纯 LF 兼容性差）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Shell / 脚本统一 LF
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.pl text eol=lf

# 主要文本类型：显式声明为文本 + LF（跨平台一致：Rust/前端/Markdown/配置）
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.scss text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.mdx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonc text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换/diff/merge（binary = -text -diff -merge）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.bmp binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.heic binary
*.cur binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.node binary
*.wasm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.bin binary
*.pdb binary
*.lib binary
*.a binary
*.rlib binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.mkv binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.flac binary

# 锁文件：统一 LF（避免 auto 启发式两语义）
*.lock text eol=lf

